{"product":{"id":7612835627236,"title":"Name Bookends (Set of 2)","body_html":"\u003cstyle\u003e\n.read-more-container {\n  max-height: 220px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  transition: max-height 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.read-more-container.expanded {\n  max-height: 3000px;\n}\n\n.read-more-toggle {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  color: #000;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: normal;\n  display: block;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"read-more-wrapper\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"read-more-container\" id=\"bookendsEN\"\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eEnhance Your Space with Customizable Bookends\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003eIf you know anyone who appreciates books and loves reading, then Kashida's Name Bookends make a great gift idea. Personalize your bookends using two Arabic words\/names written in Arabic calligraphy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n    \u003cul\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003eUpon completing your purchase, you will receive the design preview within 2-3 working days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003eProduct accommodates up to two words.\u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003c\/ul\u003e\n\n    \u003ch3\u003eStylish Organization\u003c\/h3\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003eBookends do more than just hold your books in place; they add a stylish touch to your home décor. With our Name Bookends (Set of 2), you can customize them to reflect your personality or the theme of your room. Whether you prefer modern designs or classic styles, these bookends are perfect for showcasing your book collection while keeping everything organized and tidy. They blend functionality with artistry, allowing you to create a bookshelf that is not only practical but also visually appealing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n    \u003ch3\u003ePersonalized Touch\u003c\/h3\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003eOne of the standout features of our bookends is the ability to customize them with your name or a special message. This makes these bookends ideal for personal use or as thoughtful gifts for friends and family. Imagine surprising someone with a set of bookends featuring their name; this personalized touch adds sentiment and makes a unique addition to any bookshelf, desk, or office space. People appreciate unique gifts, and these bookends serve as a memorable keepsake.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n    \u003ch3\u003eDurable and Functional\u003c\/h3\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003eThe Name Bookends are designed not only for aesthetics but also for durability. Made from high-quality materials, they ensure that your books remain securely in place, preventing any slipping or falling off the shelf. You can trust that these bookends will stand the test of time while providing the support you need. So whether you are an avid reader, a student, or just someone who enjoys a well-organized space, these bookends are a functional solution that adds charm to your environment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n  \u003c\/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cbutton class=\"read-more-toggle\" onclick=\"toggleReadMoreBookends()\"\u003eRead more\u003c\/button\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\n\u003cscript\u003e\nfunction toggleReadMoreBookends() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('bookendsEN');\n  const button = container.nextElementSibling;\n\n  container.classList.toggle('expanded');\n  button.innerText = container.classList.contains('expanded')\n    ? 'Read less'\n    : 'Read more';\n}\n\u003c\/script\u003e\n","vendor":"Kashida Design","product_type":"Customize","created_at":"2022-04-07T11:05:52+04:00","handle":"name-bookends","updated_at":"2026-11-05T13:08:45+04:00","published_at":"2022-04-07T11:16:18+04:00","template_suffix":"customize","published_scope":"web","tags":"bookends, decor, gifts, home office, organization","variants":[{"id":42725503271140,"product_id":7612835627236,"title":"Gold","price":"650.00","sku":"NB-BOO-GO","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Gold","